  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It seems that most part of default \"Home\" world does not focused in proper distance. \nIn manual focus mode, they focused with distance \"10\" (regardless of how near the object is. Please see the picture).\nThis also cause failure of autofocusing for most part of the Home world. A few exceptions are \"VRChat\" signboard on spawn point, pens, etc.\nIt does not happen in every world, but I guess the default Home world may be the first place to try camera functions for many users.",
